Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:13:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add dump-logits and cmp-prefill diagnostics for engine
 comparisons

dump-logits <model> <base> <out> replays the chunks and tokens of a
llama.cpp --kl-divergence-base file through the token-by-token decode
path and writes Astral's log-probs in the same format (b12751
perplexity.cpp encoder), so KLD and top-1 agreement can be computed
position by position against llama.cpp.

cmp-prefill also prints the largest difference among tokens within 16
logits of the top, where the overall largest difference sits, and
KL(step || prefill).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
